patrone-notepad (0.3.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * New tabs are Markdown, formatted as you type, while Settings' Markdown
    formatting is on. Before, only files named .md were: a new tab never
    was, though its setting said it should be.
  * Each tab is Markdown or plain text, switched from the status bar (with
    Show formatted and Preview beside it in the same menu), View or
    command search. A .md file opens in Markdown, any other file in plain
    text, and Save as under a new name switches by its name.
  * Save as suggests a .md file for a Markdown tab and a .txt file for a
    plain text one.

